{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkBdm4PhtsFGboMqHtWzaT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\\section{Conclusion}\n2\t\n3\tPolicy ambiguity increases agent violations by 31.0\\,pp excluding incompleteness ($+$12.7\\,pp on SOPBench, 3/5 significant), with 95.4\\% overall disambiguation neglect and a type--mechanism dissociation ($V = 0.45$, LLM-coded) motivating clause-level policy auditing over type-level risk screening.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018oVXy9VUJxaR7EecgEuZbA","session_id":"b364c86e-c33c-4dfc-add1-ad49dc9f2992","uuid":"b38c7840-3fc2-4458-b209-5a876d5d16c6","timestamp":"2026-05-23T20:02:01.211Z"}
